        _s154_ = "d. Starting from point b, we perform the next iteration until the difference between the specified and calculated Flowin value reaches the required value.",
        _s128_1 = "2.11. Calculation temperature (tout) and relative humidity (fout) of outgoing air at known Flowout, Q, temperature tout and fout",
