        _s46_0 = " in Equation (3), it is specified by the user.",
        _s206_ = "When heat emitter rating data obtained with water are used for calculations with glycol solutions, no additional correction for fluid composition is applied to the heat emitter\u2019s heat output characteristic.",
        _s11_ = "Specified: ",
        _s37_ = "T1_r, \\:\\: Tn_r, \\:\\: Flow \\:\\: rate.",
        _s52_0 = "Solution logic illustrated by a change in flow rate.",
        _s5_5 = "With ",
        _s139_ = " unchanged, a change in flow rate changes the heat output Q of the heat emitter; see Equation (1), (2) or (3), depending on the fluid type.",
        _s131_ = "However, according to Equations (4) and (5), a change in heat output must be accompanied by a change in the temperature conditions ",
